### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@roomId = 685419669aac1eb003078bf8
@reviewId = REVIEW_ID_HERE

### DEBUG - Test payload format
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews/debug
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_id": "685419669aac1eb003078bf8",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Test debug"
}

### TEST SIMPLE - Test simple endpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews/test-simple
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_id": "685419669aac1eb003078bf8",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Test simple"
}

### 1. Create Review
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "room_id": "{{roomId}}",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Phòng rất đẹp và sạch sẽ. Host rất thân thiện và nhiệt tình. Tôi sẽ quay lại!"
}

### 2. Get My Reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews?page=1&limit=10&sortBy=created_at&sortOrder=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get Room Reviews (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/rooms/{{roomId}}?page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Get Review Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Admin - Get All Reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/admin/all?page=1&limit=20&rating=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Admin - Search Reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/admin/search?keyword=đẹp&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. Admin - Get Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/admin/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Admin - Delete Review
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reviews/admin/{{reviewId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Test with different ratings
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "room_id": "685419669aac1eb003078bf8",
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "Phòng ổn, sạch sẽ nhưng hơi nhỏ"
}

